msgid "Failsafe"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-landing-page.rst:7
#: 6072a99f426d48fab9b3973636937c9f
msgid ""
"Copter has a number of failsafe mechanisms to ease vehicle recovery/prevent "
"wandering in the event that vehicle control is lost. The main failsafe "
"topics are listed below."
msgstr "Copter 具有多种失控保护机制，以便在飞行器控制丢失时辅助飞行器恢复/防止失控漂移。主要失控保护主题如下所列。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-landing-page.rst:11
#: 4bd89916c14f44e7874f6dc8316def64
msgid ""
"Once a Radio Failsafe, Battery Failsafe, GCS Failsafe or Terrain Data Loss "
"Failsafe is entered and the failsafe action taken involves a mode change to "
"the vehicle, it remain in that mode until the pilot changes the mode "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"一旦进入遥控器失控保护、电池失控保护、地面站失控保护或地形数据丢失失控保护，且失控保护动作涉及飞行器模式变更，飞行器将保持该模式，直到飞手直接更改模式。"
